Description=Anthropic's own desktop app for Claude, installed from Anthropic's apt repository (which keeps itself updated). On Starling it also gets the computer use it ships without: install the bundled starling-computer-use bridge and Claude can open, see and drive its own windows — no virtual machine, and never your windows.
